cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This citation describes the experimental dataset bundled with EIT Benchlab.
  Please cite the dataset and its report when using these measurements. The
  listed authors are dataset authors; this file does not assign software
  authorship. Software provenance is recorded in SOURCE.json.
